00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:46.700
and it cost me money before I figured it out. Imagine you own shares in a name that just printed a

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:52.140
strong earnings beat yet the stock barely moves because sector rotation is pulling money elsewhere.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:58.340
The mechanism is simple relative strength versus the benchmark tells you whether the catalyst is

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:05.780
